WEBVTT

00:15.974 --> 00:17.976
[opening theme music playing]

00:40.248 --> 00:44.961
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

00:48.882 --> 00:50.383
For a very long time now,

00:51.134 --> 00:52.969
you and I have liked each other.

00:53.052 --> 00:53.928
What?

00:56.181 --> 00:59.350
I remember when you gave me this jade.

00:59.434 --> 01:00.268
[scoffs]

01:01.603 --> 01:02.520
What do you remember?

01:02.604 --> 01:04.564
Last time, you made up
a non-existent witness.

01:05.690 --> 01:07.901
And now you're making up
non-existent memories?

01:10.987 --> 01:11.988
"They're bird's eggs."

01:13.364 --> 01:14.699
"I'll choose one, all right?"

01:17.410 --> 01:19.287
"I'll pick the red. You take blue."

01:21.915 --> 01:23.124
I'll choose one, all right?

01:23.208 --> 01:24.959
I'll pick the red. You take blue.

01:27.420 --> 01:28.421
[short gasp]

01:29.047 --> 01:29.964
You see?

01:30.048 --> 01:31.966
I'm not making up things this time, right?

01:32.050 --> 01:34.260
[dramatic music]

01:37.514 --> 01:38.807
How did you know about that?

01:40.141 --> 01:42.477
I told you, it just came to me
as soon as I held this jade.

01:42.560 --> 01:43.478
Why you? Why?

01:45.271 --> 01:46.105
Because…

01:47.357 --> 01:49.901
I have great divine powers?

01:55.115 --> 01:56.950
Do you think that memory is really mine?

01:57.033 --> 01:58.785
It probably belongs
to the owner of the jade.

02:02.038 --> 02:03.498
This yin-yang jade…

02:04.541 --> 02:05.834
is Jinyowon's, isn't it?

02:08.294 --> 02:10.004
I must have seen it there
when I was young.

02:10.672 --> 02:13.216
I saw flashbacks so I thought
they were my memories.

02:14.425 --> 02:16.344
But I guess it was the owner's, after all.

02:19.013 --> 02:20.098
Are you saying…

02:22.100 --> 02:23.518
her memory is inside that jade?

02:27.981 --> 02:29.858
I really must be a powerful priestess.

02:29.941 --> 02:31.985
I can even see memories in objects.

02:35.363 --> 02:39.075
I called you thinking you'd be pleased
that my powers were starting to return.

02:40.535 --> 02:42.412
But I guess you thought
it was her calling you.

02:43.955 --> 02:44.998
You must be upset.

02:45.081 --> 02:46.249
Yeah.

02:47.876 --> 02:49.127
I'm very upset.

02:50.628 --> 02:53.256
Then I'll just put this back in here.

03:00.805 --> 03:01.639
[sighs]

03:05.768 --> 03:06.728
[rumbles]

03:09.564 --> 03:10.398
[gasps]

03:12.859 --> 03:15.361
- [sighs]
- It collapsed again.

03:16.779 --> 03:20.199
[Jin] So why did you build
that stone tower so deep in the forest?

03:20.283 --> 03:24.078
Was it not made to commemorate her death
but rather as hope she'd return?

03:24.913 --> 03:26.664
Toppled for good, thanks to you.

03:27.415 --> 03:29.334
[Bu-yeon breathes heavily]

03:30.627 --> 03:32.211
[stones clatter]

03:37.050 --> 03:37.926
[grunts]

03:48.144 --> 03:49.938
There's no need to rebuild
what you destroyed.

03:50.021 --> 03:52.232
I didn't touch it.
Honestly, it collapsed on its own.

03:52.315 --> 03:53.149
Really?

03:54.067 --> 03:58.279
So you didn't just use
your great divine powers to disappoint me?

03:59.447 --> 04:00.490
It's true though.

04:02.992 --> 04:04.577
I stumbled upon this jade by chance,

04:05.203 --> 04:07.956
and the flashback, I thought it was mine.

04:10.708 --> 04:12.627
If you'd come before I realized anything,

04:14.087 --> 04:15.380
I probably would have been happy.

04:16.839 --> 04:17.757
Well, good then.

04:18.424 --> 04:20.510
I'm glad I'm not
the only disappointed one.

04:20.593 --> 04:22.804
How could you mistake
those memories for your own?

04:22.887 --> 04:25.348
Did you think it was yours
because you had that jade?

04:26.975 --> 04:28.893
Are there any other memories
you think are yours?

04:28.977 --> 04:29.811
There aren't.

04:31.104 --> 04:32.021
That's all I saw.

04:33.773 --> 04:36.943
Seeing someone's memory
doesn't feel good at all.

04:40.196 --> 04:41.030
[Bu-yeon] Take it.

04:43.199 --> 04:46.244
Why? You liked it
when you thought the memory was yours.

04:46.828 --> 04:48.162
Keep seeing more memories.

04:49.622 --> 04:51.374
You said we loved
each other for a long time.

04:53.042 --> 04:54.752
I want to know
what those were like for her…

04:57.171 --> 04:58.214
right before she died.

04:58.298 --> 04:59.674
I can't see anything else.

05:00.383 --> 05:02.093
Let go. You're hurting me.

05:02.719 --> 05:04.595
You need to keep that jade with you.

05:05.513 --> 05:06.806
You'll see more as your powers return.

05:06.889 --> 05:09.559
Are you trying to put me
in between you and that dead girl?

05:09.642 --> 05:11.853
You did that yourself.
You're the one who called that…

05:17.066 --> 05:19.986
Because of that, I found yet another
use for you I've never thought of.

05:20.486 --> 05:22.280
I had questions buried in that cairn,

05:22.363 --> 05:24.240
thinking I would never hear
the answers to them.

05:26.200 --> 05:27.493
I might still hear them through you.

05:27.577 --> 05:29.370
I called hoping you wouldn't come here.

05:31.122 --> 05:32.165
You shouldn't have.

05:37.170 --> 05:38.838
This is exactly why no one believed…

05:40.006 --> 05:41.883
that you and I were a married couple.

05:44.552 --> 05:46.304
And I was getting my hopes up.

05:46.387 --> 05:48.181
You got everything
you wanted by marrying me.

05:48.765 --> 05:50.016
You escaped from Jinyowon

05:50.099 --> 05:52.018
and found a place to stay
where you gained freedom.

05:53.644 --> 05:54.520
You're right.

05:56.230 --> 05:57.398
I feel better now.

05:58.399 --> 05:59.484
I feel more at ease.

06:00.526 --> 06:02.361
So your real bride was this stone tower.

06:03.112 --> 06:03.946
I'll be sure…

06:04.989 --> 06:06.365
to put her back the way she was.

06:06.449 --> 06:07.700
Do as you wish.

06:10.036 --> 06:12.455
[somber music]

06:20.171 --> 06:22.090
[sobs softly]

06:27.011 --> 06:29.514
[breathes heavily]

06:30.139 --> 06:31.057
[grunts]

06:32.600 --> 06:33.726
That bastard!

06:34.519 --> 06:37.230
So this tower is his real wife,
and I'm his second?

06:38.064 --> 06:39.649
He could have told me that before.

06:40.733 --> 06:43.569
Then I wouldn't have gotten
jealous of these rocks.

06:44.654 --> 06:46.239
Damn it!
[groans]

06:47.323 --> 06:49.200
[grunts, sighs]

06:51.119 --> 06:52.703
This is all Jang Uk's fault.

06:54.413 --> 06:57.542
That jerkface! Jang Uk, you bastard! Agh!

07:00.795 --> 07:02.964
[whimsical music playing]

07:08.386 --> 07:10.221
I should have known the moment I saw him,

07:10.721 --> 07:12.473
he was a bad person.

07:14.392 --> 07:15.309
Let alone…

07:16.269 --> 07:17.437
a horrible husband.

07:18.438 --> 07:19.730
[sighs]

07:20.606 --> 07:21.524
[grunts]

07:24.402 --> 07:27.029
[stone clatters]

07:27.113 --> 07:28.114
[sniffles, exhales]

07:28.698 --> 07:29.657
[owl hooting]

07:37.999 --> 07:40.710
- [tummy rumbles]
- Gosh, I'm so hungry.

07:42.753 --> 07:47.383
[animal howling]

07:49.927 --> 07:51.512
What's that? A wolf?

07:52.180 --> 07:55.308
There aren't any tigers
on this mountain, are there?

07:57.393 --> 07:58.895
- [bird caws]
- [gasps]

08:06.736 --> 08:08.738
[dramatic music]

08:15.453 --> 08:17.538
Fine then! Come and eat me alive!

08:20.917 --> 08:22.168
If I get eaten alive,

08:23.461 --> 08:25.004
at least he'll build a cairn for me.

08:27.715 --> 08:28.591
[sniffles]

08:35.473 --> 08:37.725
[light music playing]

08:45.066 --> 08:45.983
[exhales softly]

08:59.956 --> 09:01.749
I was expecting tigers and wolves…

09:03.876 --> 09:05.169
but bugs came instead.

09:13.135 --> 09:14.387
Did I summon them?

09:21.561 --> 09:22.436
[sighs in relief]

09:23.104 --> 09:23.938
[sniffles]

09:29.944 --> 09:31.946
["I′m Sorry" by Ailee playing]

10:34.258 --> 10:35.801
[Mr. Lee] Young Lady Bu-yeon!

10:36.677 --> 10:39.055
- My lady!
- [manservant] Young Lady!

10:39.138 --> 10:41.390
- [maid] Young Lady!
- Where are you?

10:41.474 --> 10:44.644
- [manservant] Young Lady Jin!
- [Mr. Lee] Please answer if you're there!

10:44.727 --> 10:45.811
- Oh, I'm here!
- [maid] Young Lady!

10:45.895 --> 10:47.313
- I'm here! Here!
- [Mr. Lee] My lady?

10:47.396 --> 10:48.230
[manservant] Young Lady Jin!

10:48.981 --> 10:50.566
- [Mr. Lee] Is-Is that you, my lady?
- [Bu-yeon sobs]

10:50.650 --> 10:51.859
[Mr. Lee] Oh, my goodness.

10:56.489 --> 10:58.491
[soft music]

11:00.493 --> 11:02.328
We were worried about you, my lady.

11:02.953 --> 11:06.123
- Let us go home now.
- [manservant] Come on down, please!

11:07.958 --> 11:10.169
- Careful! Careful, careful!
- Oh, thank you.

11:10.252 --> 11:12.922
Once the sun sets, it gets cold here.

11:15.549 --> 11:17.093
- [Bu-yeon sniffles]
- Here, lady.

11:18.886 --> 11:21.639
[sighs]
My goodness. Let's walk back down.

11:21.722 --> 11:23.057
- Thank you.
- [Mr. Lee] Dear me.

11:24.558 --> 11:25.935
[Mr. Lee] Did anything happen?

11:29.814 --> 11:32.274
Prepare a hot bath for her
as soon as we get home, okay?

11:37.696 --> 11:38.531
[sighs]

11:39.281 --> 11:40.616
[Eunuch Oh] I took care
of the powder incident

11:40.699 --> 11:42.118
as requested, Your Highness.

11:42.201 --> 11:43.536
From now on, if you hear any more rumors

11:43.619 --> 11:45.204
about the Queen
getting involved with sorcery,

11:46.080 --> 11:47.164
come tell me immediately.

11:47.832 --> 11:48.916
Yes.

11:49.458 --> 11:50.459
But, Royal Highness,

11:51.043 --> 11:52.837
why did you bring that to the palace?

11:52.920 --> 11:55.923
Oh, it kept looking at me
so I couldn't just leave it to die.

11:56.006 --> 11:57.842
I was worried the shaman who suggested it

11:57.925 --> 11:59.552
would curse me if I didn't purchase it.

11:59.635 --> 12:00.678
A shaman?

12:01.470 --> 12:02.304
Uh, yeah.

12:02.847 --> 12:05.349
She said that I should raise
this turtle instead of having children.

12:05.433 --> 12:06.725
- [chuckles]
- What? Who would dare

12:06.809 --> 12:07.977
to be so disrespectful

12:08.060 --> 12:10.146
and say such impudent things
to Your Royal Highness?

12:10.229 --> 12:11.313
She probably didn't know.

12:12.148 --> 12:15.317
She had mistaken me for a eunuch.
She must be really dumb.

12:15.401 --> 12:17.945
Then, I will raise this turtle,
Royal Highness.

12:18.988 --> 12:21.073
You can't. It is too late.

12:21.157 --> 12:22.825
[Go Won] It already knows
that I am its owner.

12:22.908 --> 12:23.993
So it only obeys me.

12:24.869 --> 12:27.037
- The turtle?
- Mm. Yeah, watch.

12:27.121 --> 12:29.707
All right, Turtle. Turtle!
Lift your head up.

12:29.790 --> 12:31.083
[quirky music]

12:31.167 --> 12:32.209
You see?

12:34.295 --> 12:35.129
Hmm.

12:35.212 --> 12:37.298
She did say that it had very good energy.

12:38.090 --> 12:41.844
It's very clever.
Next time, I should make him flip over.

12:41.927 --> 12:45.222
Oh, but… turtles die
if they flip on their backs.

12:45.306 --> 12:47.183
- Really?
- Yes, Sire.

12:49.602 --> 12:53.439
Hey, Turtle, never ever flip
on your back, okay? That's an order.

12:55.691 --> 12:57.318
[Eunuch Oh] Wow! It's not flipping over.

12:58.110 --> 12:59.528
It's very handsome.

12:59.612 --> 13:01.363
- Wow!
- [chuckles]

13:10.706 --> 13:12.708
[foreboding music]

13:17.046 --> 13:18.047
[exhales deeply]

13:25.095 --> 13:25.930
[screams]

13:30.684 --> 13:31.519
[gasps]

13:37.316 --> 13:38.275
[whimpers]

13:41.487 --> 13:43.572
- [screams]
- [flesh gurgles]

13:47.910 --> 13:48.744
[gasps]

13:49.286 --> 13:53.123
[Naksu] Everywhere I go, heads fall
from shoulders. Hence, Naksu.

13:53.207 --> 13:57.419
I will find a body
to shift my soul into and return.

14:02.591 --> 14:03.509
[Byeong-gu] Help!

14:05.469 --> 14:06.303
Help me!

14:06.845 --> 14:08.681
- Help!
- [men chattering]

14:10.349 --> 14:11.934
- It's Naksu!
- [man] Come over here!

14:12.017 --> 14:14.311
- It's Naksu! Naksu!
- Come over here! Come over here!

14:14.395 --> 14:16.522
The shadow assassin! It is her!

14:17.648 --> 14:19.316
Agh! In the middle of the lake!

14:19.400 --> 14:21.694
Naksu came back and killed everyone!

14:21.777 --> 14:23.487
She said she'd shift souls and return!

14:23.571 --> 14:25.489
It is all true! Run away!

14:25.573 --> 14:28.117
Run! Save yourselves!

14:28.200 --> 14:30.369
Run away quickly! Hurry!

14:30.452 --> 14:32.872
She's gonna catch you! Save yourselves!

14:32.955 --> 14:34.748
Naksu is back!

14:35.249 --> 14:36.750
- [man] Naksu is back!
- [woman screams]

14:36.834 --> 14:38.460
- Naksu!
- [crowd shouting]

14:41.630 --> 14:43.924
[crowd clamoring]

14:49.680 --> 14:50.514
[Jang Uk] Yul?

14:54.560 --> 14:55.644
What brings you here?

14:55.728 --> 14:56.687
I moved here last night.

14:57.271 --> 14:59.732
Chwiseonru is nice,
but it still doesn't feel like home to me.

15:03.110 --> 15:05.613
What about you? Why are you here?
You have a perfectly good home.

15:05.696 --> 15:07.615
Don't know.
I just feel more comfortable here.

15:07.698 --> 15:09.992
It's not good
that you feel comfortable here.

15:10.075 --> 15:11.410
You have someone waiting for you at home.

15:11.493 --> 15:13.120
You must have already met her.

15:13.996 --> 15:15.956
[sighs]
Maidservant Kim keeps insisting

15:16.040 --> 15:18.083
that we need to splurge
on a big wedding ceremony.

15:19.585 --> 15:21.253
Until then, I'm staying out of trouble.

15:23.547 --> 15:25.341
Then we should offer
our congratulations, right?

15:26.342 --> 15:27.301
Truly though?

15:31.305 --> 15:33.140
How do you feel? Do you feel better?

15:33.223 --> 15:35.017
You were very ill before you left.

15:36.560 --> 15:38.103
And you still don't look much better--

15:38.187 --> 15:39.772
I'm just a bit tired from the journey.

15:41.440 --> 15:42.441
That's even weirder.

15:42.524 --> 15:45.235
It's already been days
since your journey. Really, Yul?

15:48.739 --> 15:49.615
[sighs]

15:49.698 --> 15:52.701
Jeongjingak feels quite a bit colder
since everyone left.

15:52.785 --> 15:55.621
It's hot outside, but chilly in here.

15:56.914 --> 15:58.499
Maybe it's because of me.

15:58.582 --> 16:00.376
The ice stone is supposed
to attract wraiths,

16:00.960 --> 16:02.461
so the air around me is always cold.

16:05.714 --> 16:06.548
I see.

16:09.468 --> 16:10.427
Then you must be…

16:12.388 --> 16:13.472
cold all the time.

16:14.640 --> 16:17.017
[emotional music]

16:21.605 --> 16:22.481
Yul.
[sighs]

16:23.232 --> 16:24.900
Please don't make
that face like that, huh?

16:25.818 --> 16:28.445
I mean, if you put it that way,
it makes me want to throw myself

16:28.529 --> 16:30.406
into your arms and give you
a big hug, you know?

16:37.413 --> 16:38.872
I mean, I can give you a hug, sure.

16:40.791 --> 16:41.834
Come! Come here.

16:41.917 --> 16:44.628
What's with you?
What happened over the last three years?

16:45.921 --> 16:48.173
- I guess you were lonely?
- I really was.

16:48.257 --> 16:50.592
- Just let me hug my friend.
- Hey, don't be like that.

16:50.676 --> 16:52.636
- It's just a hug.
- No, no, no! Wait! Stop it!

16:52.720 --> 16:53.762
[Dang-gu] Hey.

16:54.555 --> 16:55.931
What is it? What's going on?

16:56.598 --> 16:58.726
You guys spent one night together,
and now you are leaving me out?

16:58.809 --> 17:00.853
Keep this up and I'm gonna move here too!

17:00.936 --> 17:04.565
Hey, Dang-gu, Yul is being strange.
He used to be pure and naive.

17:04.648 --> 17:07.776
- But look here, he's become sly.
- Our Seo Yul?

17:07.860 --> 17:10.779
Has our Yul, who has always been
as pure as the new-born infant

17:10.863 --> 17:11.947
been corrupted?

17:12.990 --> 17:14.199
Has he changed?

17:14.283 --> 17:15.242
[soft chuckle]

17:16.326 --> 17:17.327
Have I really changed?

17:18.370 --> 17:20.372
They say that you die
if you change all of a sudden.

17:25.502 --> 17:27.755
It's a good thing
I got to see you guys before that.

17:28.589 --> 17:29.423
I'm glad I returned.

17:30.299 --> 17:32.301
Are you sure about that?
You might regret it later.

17:32.384 --> 17:34.845
My uncle just invited
the three of us over for breakfast.

17:36.638 --> 17:38.474
- Please tell him that I went back.
- And you didn't see me here.

17:39.058 --> 17:40.851
Hey, wait, wait, wait, wait!
If you don't go,

17:40.934 --> 17:42.644
I'm gonna have to eat
all three portions myself.

17:44.271 --> 17:45.105
[Jang Uk sighs]

17:45.189 --> 17:46.398
You're my friends.

17:46.482 --> 17:48.525
[quirky music playing]

17:48.609 --> 17:50.110
- Please help me.
- Should we do?

17:50.194 --> 17:51.987
- Let's go.
- Hmm, let's go.

17:52.613 --> 17:54.865
[whimpers]
Let's go eat then.

17:55.699 --> 17:59.078
All right, I hope you enjoyed your meal.
For dessert, rice cakes.

18:00.204 --> 18:03.290
We already managed a full meal,
so a rice cake should be easy.

18:03.874 --> 18:05.084
At least this is the last thing.

18:05.167 --> 18:08.670
Normal rice cakes are boring, so I came up
with a name for this special dessert.

18:08.754 --> 18:11.423
It is called "Better choice Rice Cakes."

18:11.507 --> 18:15.052
Two of the three are filled with honey,
and one is filled with fish sauce.

18:15.135 --> 18:16.678
It sounds exciting, doesn't it?

18:16.762 --> 18:19.556
It took me two days…

18:21.266 --> 18:23.018
and one night to come up with this game.

18:23.102 --> 18:25.229
May I ask why you even
came up with this idea?

18:26.188 --> 18:28.440
This rice cakes will tell you
how your day will go.

18:29.108 --> 18:31.902
Whoever picks the fish sauce cake
will have terrible luck.

18:31.985 --> 18:34.613
So be careful! Go on, pick one.

18:35.364 --> 18:38.242
The fish sauce truly ought to smell.
[sniffs]

18:38.325 --> 18:41.870
I knew you would try that, so I imbued it
with energy when I made it.

18:41.954 --> 18:45.415
There is no way that the smell
will be able to escape the rice cake.

18:45.499 --> 18:46.375
[laughs]

18:52.464 --> 18:54.842
You wasted your precious energy
on making these rice cakes?

18:54.925 --> 18:56.385
You must be pretty bored, huh?

18:56.468 --> 18:59.179
Yeah. Of course, you have
to be very bored to do this.

19:00.264 --> 19:02.432
Okay, go on and pick one.

19:02.516 --> 19:04.643
Ugh, I have such a hard time
making decisions like this, so…

19:05.644 --> 19:06.979
Then let me just go first.

19:08.605 --> 19:10.023
[exhales deeply]

19:10.107 --> 19:12.359
[dramatic music playing]

19:22.369 --> 19:24.830
- Honey.
- Wow, I was going to pick that one.

19:26.874 --> 19:28.375
I don't want to be the last one, so…

19:31.003 --> 19:33.005
[dramatic music playing]

19:37.009 --> 19:39.344
- It's honey.
- My lord, did you really have to

19:39.428 --> 19:41.930
go to all this trouble
just to ruin my day?

19:42.014 --> 19:43.098
Hey, hey, hey! No, no, Uk.

19:43.682 --> 19:46.852
Why eat it? You know it has fish sauce.
Here, have a bite of mine.

19:46.935 --> 19:48.020
No one…

19:49.271 --> 19:51.899
is going to check what's inside of it?

19:51.982 --> 19:54.735
Well, you already said
one was filled with fish sauce.

19:54.818 --> 19:56.653
- So it must have fish sauce.
- Are you absolutely positive

19:56.737 --> 19:57.946
it's filled with fish sauce?

19:58.614 --> 20:00.240
I mean, yeah, I believe you, Uncle.

20:00.824 --> 20:03.785
Besides, I don't want to take any chances
just to see if it actually is or not.

20:03.869 --> 20:07.122
Based on the rules you gave us,
this one has fish sauce.

20:08.624 --> 20:09.917
If we start doubting even the rules,

20:10.000 --> 20:11.627
then how can we predict
anything in this world.

20:24.223 --> 20:26.099
- Is it really honey?
- Fish sauce?

20:28.852 --> 20:30.145
What was the purpose of this joke?

20:30.229 --> 20:33.774
Life is a game of chances,
but you choose your own destiny.

20:33.857 --> 20:39.571
Whether it's sweet or bitter,
taste it for yourself and swallow it.

20:41.990 --> 20:43.158
Oh, I forgot the rice punch.

20:43.825 --> 20:45.577
Wait here.
[chuckles]

20:52.626 --> 20:54.962
- What was it?
- Based on my lord's own logic,

20:56.129 --> 20:59.049
no matter what I say to you,
you guys won't believe me at all.

20:59.633 --> 21:02.594
I'm the only one who knows
what it was I chose to eat.

21:03.845 --> 21:05.555
It was fish sauce, right?

21:07.599 --> 21:09.518
[pants]
This is where you all were.

21:10.686 --> 21:11.520
Sang-ho.

21:14.022 --> 21:15.065
What brings you here?

21:15.148 --> 21:18.026
A ridiculous rumor spread overnight.
It can't be brushed aside.

21:18.110 --> 21:19.361
What ridiculous rumor?

21:20.904 --> 21:23.824
A lot of people were massacred
on a boat at Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

21:23.907 --> 21:25.993
They say that it was Naksu's doing.

21:27.119 --> 21:29.788
[tense music]

21:29.871 --> 21:31.039
What do you mean?

21:31.123 --> 21:33.709
Phew! How can Naksu
kill anyone when she's dead?

21:33.792 --> 21:36.086
[Sang-ho] Apparently, her soul appeared
as a grotesque at the lake.

21:36.169 --> 21:38.922
They also say that she claimed
to shift souls and return.

21:39.006 --> 21:42.259
Right now, the capital is terrified
of the rumors people are spreading.

21:49.891 --> 21:53.061
Come, these charms will
protect you from Naksu.

21:53.145 --> 21:56.523
These charms will ward off her spirit.
Come! Gather around!

21:56.606 --> 21:59.151
This charm is the very charm
that will fend off soul shifters.

21:59.234 --> 22:01.528
Naksu will come for you. Protect yourself!

22:01.611 --> 22:02.696
Yes, yes, of course!

22:02.779 --> 22:04.614
[intense music playing]

22:16.293 --> 22:19.254
Protect yourself and your family
from Naksu! Here!

22:19.338 --> 22:21.882
[man] Protect yourself
with this charm. Here! Here!

22:27.262 --> 22:30.348
I should not be selling these,
but I'm giving them just to you.

22:32.309 --> 22:33.351
Mom!

22:34.102 --> 22:35.812
- You look fine.
- [little girl sighs]

22:37.230 --> 22:39.608
I've been asking around all the boats,

22:39.691 --> 22:41.651
but there were none
that had people die on them.

22:41.735 --> 22:45.697
Then that means someone is lying
about Naksu's resurrection to this world.

22:45.781 --> 22:48.825
Every now and then, there have been
stories about Naksu's ghost.

22:49.326 --> 22:52.204
But what's this about
her returning as a soul shifter?

22:53.413 --> 22:55.499
It will soon be
the third anniversary of Naksu's death.

22:56.500 --> 22:59.795
They say she will shift souls
and return on that exact day.

22:59.878 --> 23:00.712
Ah…

23:01.254 --> 23:02.672
that's why the rumor came about now.

23:05.008 --> 23:06.593
Uk must really hate this.

23:08.887 --> 23:09.721
His luck…

23:10.806 --> 23:12.015
really is bad.

23:13.141 --> 23:14.851
We should find out who started this rumor.

23:14.935 --> 23:18.480
I mean, the people at Gaema Village
have spread crazy rumors before

23:18.563 --> 23:19.481
just to sell more charms.

23:19.564 --> 23:20.398
Don't waste your time.

23:20.482 --> 23:22.526
Still, it all started
with a boat that didn't exist.

23:23.443 --> 23:24.277
[sighs]

23:24.361 --> 23:28.448
Please find out the identity
of the man who swam out of the lake?

23:29.366 --> 23:30.200
Yes.

23:34.538 --> 23:37.415
[Queen] They say
rumors of Naksu have spread like wildfire.

23:37.499 --> 23:39.835
She's a nuisance even after death.

23:39.918 --> 23:42.462
Right now, the young women
in the capital are terrified

23:42.546 --> 23:45.715
Naksu will steal their bodies,
so they are frantically buying charms.

23:45.799 --> 23:50.595
But do the people…
really know what Naksu looks like at all?

23:51.805 --> 23:54.516
I have no idea. Does anyone really know?

23:54.599 --> 23:57.602
Some say she's a giant
that is taller than the tallest man.

23:57.686 --> 24:01.064
Some say she keeps herself hidden
because she has a hideous face. And…

24:02.732 --> 24:04.609
some say she's a great beauty.

24:04.693 --> 24:05.527
Really?

24:06.111 --> 24:07.779
[Sun] First, she was a shadow assassin.

24:07.863 --> 24:09.447
Then she was a servant girl.

24:10.532 --> 24:14.327
I suppose that no one can really know
what she'll look like this time.

24:14.995 --> 24:15.829
Indeed.

24:17.747 --> 24:18.623
[exclaims]

24:19.374 --> 24:22.627
[tense music]

24:36.516 --> 24:38.768
[Bu-yeon]
People are very frightened of Naksu.

24:39.978 --> 24:41.479
What kind of person was she?

24:41.563 --> 24:43.190
[Ju-wol] Are you buying a charm as well?

24:46.234 --> 24:48.862
Everyone was buying them,
so I was just curious.

24:48.945 --> 24:51.615
If it is indeed a charm
that will ward off Naksu,

24:51.698 --> 24:53.450
you should acquire one for sure then.

24:53.533 --> 24:56.369
Because you are the one
she must be most upset with.

24:56.453 --> 24:57.913
You stole her beau.

24:59.831 --> 25:01.082
So how did it go?

25:03.793 --> 25:05.670
Did you know her?

25:07.005 --> 25:09.799
The person I got to know
was just a small servant girl.

25:09.883 --> 25:12.219
A feisty and unlucky girl.

25:12.761 --> 25:15.513
Could I get 30 charms
and some incense sticks too?

25:15.597 --> 25:17.432
- Yes, ma'am.
- For the anniversary of her death.

25:17.515 --> 25:19.976
So were you close with her?

25:20.060 --> 25:21.895
Oh, goodness, no.

25:21.978 --> 25:24.898
There's no way I can say that now.
I have a business.

25:28.610 --> 25:29.569
Would you like a drink?

25:33.114 --> 25:36.076
[waitress]
Madam, the Crown Prince is here.

25:36.159 --> 25:38.662
Oh, the Crown Prince? It's been a while.

25:38.745 --> 25:41.498
He has asked for
the cinnamon and ginger wine he likes.

25:41.581 --> 25:46.127
Ah. My lady, an important customer's here,
so I must attend to him.

25:46.211 --> 25:47.671
Go and wait for me there.

25:48.588 --> 25:49.881
Do we have that wine left?

25:51.925 --> 25:52.842
The Crown Prince?

26:00.642 --> 26:04.312
Ah! Well, she bought so many.
They were so pricey though.

26:04.396 --> 26:05.272
[Go Won] Shaman.

26:08.400 --> 26:09.276
Turtle Shaman.

26:10.360 --> 26:11.319
It is you.

26:13.321 --> 26:14.155
Ah!

26:14.698 --> 26:16.866
You are that eunuch, right?
[chuckles softly]

26:16.950 --> 26:18.034
We meet again.

26:20.870 --> 26:22.789
Are you also here to sell charms?

26:22.872 --> 26:25.083
So you've been going around
selling such things?

26:25.166 --> 26:27.168
The owner of this inn bought these.

26:27.252 --> 26:30.255
You sold all of those?
Then you must have made good money.

26:30.338 --> 26:32.882
Now then, go on.
Use that money to buy that turtle.

26:33.800 --> 26:35.885
So did you not buy it that day?

26:35.969 --> 26:37.220
You just left it there?

26:38.054 --> 26:39.055
Well, so what?

26:39.639 --> 26:41.349
Why would I buy such a useless thing?

26:41.433 --> 26:43.435
[sighs]
I told you that it possessed good energy.

26:43.518 --> 26:45.520
- And it was cute too.
- You say it's cute?

26:45.603 --> 26:46.438
[scoffs]

26:46.980 --> 26:50.108
Do you have any idea how impressive
all of my pets happen to be?

26:50.191 --> 26:52.319
I own a peacock and a white horse.

26:52.402 --> 26:53.987
A mere turtle can't even compare.

26:54.612 --> 26:55.447
Ah.

26:58.908 --> 27:00.493
It's understandable you don't care.

27:01.328 --> 27:03.705
Especially when you have
such impressive pets as those.

27:06.666 --> 27:07.959
One can't be upset…

27:09.252 --> 27:10.795
for having been abandoned then.

27:10.879 --> 27:12.881
[somber music playing]

27:13.548 --> 27:14.382
What?

27:15.050 --> 27:16.176
Did someone abandon you?

27:17.969 --> 27:20.472
My husband left
and isn't coming back home.

27:20.555 --> 27:21.473
Your husband?

27:23.475 --> 27:24.476
Why?

27:26.686 --> 27:27.520
[sighs]

27:28.355 --> 27:29.606
[clicks tongue, sighs]

27:30.648 --> 27:32.692
Your husband must have
a peacock of his own, huh?

27:36.863 --> 27:38.406
I'm sorry for urging you to buy it

27:38.907 --> 27:40.950
when you have
such impressive pets already.

27:41.034 --> 27:44.120
I don't know if the turtle would
still be alive, but I should go check.

27:45.205 --> 27:46.539
The turtle won't be there.

27:47.499 --> 27:49.876
I took it home.
You said it had good energy.

27:51.044 --> 27:53.129
I found it to be
quite clever and cute as well.

27:54.297 --> 27:55.840
It's still nothing compared to my peacock.

27:55.924 --> 27:57.384
But it has its own charm.

27:58.676 --> 28:00.553
So now, you should also…

28:02.013 --> 28:02.847
keep your chin up.

28:04.057 --> 28:05.308
I was right about you.

28:06.935 --> 28:08.603
You really are a good person.

28:12.857 --> 28:13.775
Yeah, right.

28:15.693 --> 28:18.029
How is it? Is the turtle doing well?

28:19.322 --> 28:21.533
- Do you want to see it now? Would you?
- [gasps]

28:21.616 --> 28:23.576
I can bring it over here
if you want me to.

28:24.494 --> 28:25.453
Can you really?

28:25.537 --> 28:27.789
I'm assuming you're here
to see the Crown Prince.

28:28.790 --> 28:29.874
Are you allowed to bring it here?

28:29.958 --> 28:31.584
Hmm, the Crown Prince…

28:33.878 --> 28:36.506
His Royal Highness doesn't
mind such things.

28:36.589 --> 28:40.093
Uh… he seems to be very kind.

28:40.802 --> 28:41.636
Mm.

28:42.345 --> 28:45.140
I'll leave it here for a little while,
so stop by and see it.

28:45.223 --> 28:46.307
Okay, I will.

28:47.183 --> 28:50.437
I think I should be off now.
And shouldn't you also get going?

28:58.945 --> 28:59.863
Royal Highness.

29:00.613 --> 29:02.115
Are you feeling a little better?

29:02.198 --> 29:04.868
They have the cinnamon wine
you really like. Let us go in.

29:04.951 --> 29:06.953
[inhales deeply]
Forget it.

29:07.036 --> 29:10.498
I feel better after having a short chat.
Let's start heading back.

29:11.124 --> 29:14.461
Oh! If we return to the palace now though,
Jang Uk will be there.

29:15.128 --> 29:17.839
I heard His Majesty
has summoned him to discuss Naksu.

29:17.922 --> 29:19.048
Jang Uk?

29:19.716 --> 29:21.301
Why are you telling me this now? Move it.

29:22.594 --> 29:25.054
You said you were in a bad mood
and wanted to go for a drink.

29:25.138 --> 29:27.766
Are you gonna go see Jang Uk?
Royal Highness.

29:35.148 --> 29:37.817
They say Naksu appeared
at Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

29:37.901 --> 29:39.194
The boats couldn't cross,

29:39.277 --> 29:41.404
causing great problems
with the transportation.

29:42.781 --> 29:46.993
Jang Uk, get rid of her spirit
and set people's minds at ease.

29:47.076 --> 29:49.412
If I try to get rid of something
that doesn't exist,

29:49.496 --> 29:52.624
it will only cause people
to believe that it really does exist.

29:53.374 --> 29:54.209
[Sun clears throat]

29:55.543 --> 29:59.088
I don't believe the rumors either,
but they are getting out of control.

29:59.172 --> 30:01.800
Just let it be a rumor.
They will forget about it.

30:04.803 --> 30:07.847
Your Majesty,
if Jang Uk does not take action on this,

30:07.931 --> 30:10.642
I fear it might cause even more unrest.

30:11.684 --> 30:13.144
Really? Even more unrest, you say?

30:13.228 --> 30:15.230
[Jin Mu]
The soul shifter that has appeared now

30:16.105 --> 30:19.067
is different from the soul shifters
he's dealt with before.

30:19.943 --> 30:21.486
Naksu is the one.

30:25.031 --> 30:28.409
Jang Uk, you and Naksu
were once married, were you not?

30:28.493 --> 30:31.412
And everyone in Daeho
is well aware of that fact.

30:33.122 --> 30:33.957
Sire.

30:35.208 --> 30:36.835
That's exactly what concerns me.

30:36.918 --> 30:40.421
I'm afraid that people might think
that he is refusing to kill Naksu's spirit

30:40.505 --> 30:41.881
not because it does not exist,

30:42.590 --> 30:44.300
but because he still cares for her.

30:45.176 --> 30:48.221
For the past three years, Jang Uk has used
the power of the ice stone

30:48.304 --> 30:50.765
to get rid of the soul shifters
with the Assembly's permission.

30:50.849 --> 30:52.976
Although people were afraid of his power,

30:53.059 --> 30:55.270
they believed
he'd protect them from dark sorcery.

30:55.353 --> 30:57.897
However, I'm worried
they might start doubting that now

30:57.981 --> 30:59.440
because of this rumor, Sire.

31:00.525 --> 31:02.068
He has to put an end to it.

31:03.194 --> 31:05.029
Jin Mu has a good point here.

31:05.697 --> 31:08.867
Jang Uk, do everything
you can to get rid of Naksu's spirit,

31:09.367 --> 31:11.452
so you can put an end to this rumor.

31:14.998 --> 31:17.166
[intense music]

31:17.250 --> 31:18.209
Very well, Sire.

31:19.252 --> 31:22.881
Since you're concerned about this,
I'll get rid of her myself.

31:25.508 --> 31:26.634
I give you my word, Sire.

31:27.635 --> 31:28.928
And I'll take my leave now.

31:36.936 --> 31:39.480
[intense music continues]

32:08.551 --> 32:11.220
[Go Won] How do you expect him to
get rid of something that doesn't exist?

32:11.304 --> 32:12.305
That's right.

32:13.473 --> 32:15.642
He'll never be able to get rid of her.

32:16.142 --> 32:20.647
Jang Uk will forever be haunted
by Naksu, unable to escape her spirit.

32:20.730 --> 32:24.525
People believe Naksu will shift souls
and Jang Uk will return to her.

32:24.609 --> 32:27.236
From now on, every soul shifter
that appears before him

32:27.320 --> 32:29.072
will be suspected of being Naksu.

32:29.155 --> 32:31.157
And if that soul shifter kills anyone,

32:31.240 --> 32:33.743
then they won't just blame Naksu.

32:34.535 --> 32:36.287
Jang Uk will surely be blamed as well.

32:36.871 --> 32:41.501
He will continue to chase
after the memory of Naksu over and over

32:41.584 --> 32:43.211
with no end in sight.

32:44.253 --> 32:46.547
He will writhe in agony,
trapped in everyone's…

32:47.215 --> 32:49.008
fears for what happened.

32:50.510 --> 32:51.344
[sighs]

32:53.054 --> 32:56.182
So Naksu will be used
as a net to entrap him then.

32:56.265 --> 32:58.434
I'm doing all of this for you, Sire.

32:59.268 --> 33:03.898
The first thing I plan to do
is bring Jinyowon to the royal family.

33:05.233 --> 33:06.067
Jinyowon?

33:06.150 --> 33:09.696
So we cannot let
the heiress of Jinyowon marry Jang Uk.

33:09.779 --> 33:14.033
Naksu will be the one
who can separate the two of them.

33:20.373 --> 33:21.207
[snickers]

33:21.290 --> 33:24.794
I found out who it was
that saw Naksu and swam back to shore.

33:24.877 --> 33:25.920
Who? Tell me.

33:26.504 --> 33:27.880
He was a man who used to live

33:27.964 --> 33:29.424
on the boat and did
some kind of chores there.

33:30.174 --> 33:32.802
His name was Byeong-gu
and I suspect he spread the rumor

33:32.885 --> 33:34.595
after shamans offered
to pay him some money.

33:34.679 --> 33:38.266
They said that he swam out of the lake
late in the middle of the night.

33:39.017 --> 33:40.977
And that's why this rumor
has spread as being true.

33:41.060 --> 33:43.271
[sighs]
I don't think that he risked his life…

33:44.105 --> 33:45.648
just to spread a false rumor.

33:45.732 --> 33:47.942
They say he gambles
every time he gets money.

33:48.026 --> 33:50.611
So I'll search the gambling houses
first chance I get.

33:51.487 --> 33:53.489
[tense music]

34:04.959 --> 34:07.003
[laughs]

34:09.297 --> 34:10.631
Leave Daeho Fortress for now.

34:13.217 --> 34:15.553
And make sure you don't come back
until the sixth of the month.

34:16.179 --> 34:18.973
That's the day Naksu died, right?
Is she really…

34:19.057 --> 34:21.142
gonna shift souls and return on that day?

34:24.771 --> 34:25.813
[clears throat]

34:27.607 --> 34:30.651
If she really does return, I'd like to…

34:31.819 --> 34:34.572
meet her and ask her
a couple of questions of my own.

34:37.033 --> 34:37.950
[scoffs]

34:42.038 --> 34:44.665
I think that's enough for me
to understand their relationship.

34:45.500 --> 34:46.375
You can stop now.

34:47.085 --> 34:51.297
This is where they first met each other.
And this is where he proposed to her.

34:52.298 --> 34:56.385
- I know all about it.
- Ju-wol, I don't need to hear anymore!

34:56.469 --> 34:59.680
- Please just stop, okay?
- One time, she got so drunk here,

34:59.764 --> 35:01.766
Young Master Jang carried her home

35:01.849 --> 35:03.476
- on his back.
- [gasps]

35:03.559 --> 35:05.394
Whenever she saw these honey biscuits,

35:05.478 --> 35:08.481
she always took some home with her,
saying they're his favorite.

35:15.321 --> 35:17.323
[quirky music playing]

35:31.045 --> 35:32.880
Here. Let us all share a drink.

35:37.093 --> 35:38.010
[exhales]

35:39.387 --> 35:41.764
I was summoned to the palace
by His Majesty the King,

35:41.848 --> 35:44.725
and also my cousin, the Queen,
once again today.

35:44.809 --> 35:47.353
Before that, I had tea with the Gwanju.

35:47.436 --> 35:50.690
So, are you no longer
going to return to Seoho Fortress?

35:51.274 --> 35:53.776
Jeongjingak was established
by Master Seo Gyeong,

35:53.860 --> 35:55.444
a member of the Seo family.

35:55.528 --> 35:58.489
But since it's in ruins,
I've been thinking of restoring it myself.

35:58.573 --> 35:59.866
- [Hyo] Jeongjingak?
- [Beom exclaims]

35:59.949 --> 36:01.325
You are so incredible.

36:02.702 --> 36:05.705
It's just an idea.
I still need to talk to the Queen.

36:08.833 --> 36:10.209
Where's the owner of the inn?

36:10.793 --> 36:12.253
I'm trying to treat my guests over here.

36:12.336 --> 36:16.090
She's busy. She's with Jin Bu-yeon,
the eldest daughter of Jinyowon.

36:16.799 --> 36:17.842
Jin Bu-yeon?

36:21.220 --> 36:22.346
[scoffs]

36:23.389 --> 36:25.266
So he met her and even proposed here?

36:25.349 --> 36:26.976
[sighs]
I wish I never knew!

36:27.810 --> 36:29.812
- [loud ringing]
- [eerie music]

36:31.731 --> 36:33.191
Marry your young master.

36:37.945 --> 36:38.821
What was that?

36:46.412 --> 36:48.122
It was her memories again.

36:50.750 --> 36:52.793
Her memories really are coming to me.

36:56.380 --> 36:58.883
Young lady. Someone wishes to see you.

36:58.966 --> 37:00.593
He says you are both acquainted.

37:04.096 --> 37:05.306
[laughter]

37:07.725 --> 37:09.101
[all exhale]

37:10.186 --> 37:11.020
Huh, Yul?

37:11.729 --> 37:13.231
[Hyo] Oh, long time no see.

37:16.359 --> 37:17.193
[Seo Yul] Uncle Yun-o,

37:17.860 --> 37:19.820
I thought you're heading back
to Seoho Fortress tomorrow?

37:19.904 --> 37:21.781
I have decided to stay here for now.

37:21.864 --> 37:23.366
Please, Yul, sit with us.

37:23.449 --> 37:24.951
I only came by to say hello.

37:25.785 --> 37:26.702
I said sit.

37:27.954 --> 37:29.622
You are in for something fun.

37:30.331 --> 37:32.416
That girl I called off
the engagement with, right?

37:32.500 --> 37:34.085
She's here. I just called for her.

37:34.168 --> 37:35.586
He says she's all dumb,

37:35.670 --> 37:38.422
but decided to marry her
because she was pretty.

37:38.506 --> 37:41.550
We were curious about her, so he was
going to show the young lady to us.

37:41.634 --> 37:44.262
[Yeol] But how stupid would she
have to actually be to show up?

37:44.345 --> 37:46.264
Sounds like
she really is nothing but looks.

37:46.347 --> 37:47.682
[laughs]

37:47.765 --> 37:50.351
You all seem to have misunderstood
my uncle.

37:53.104 --> 37:55.189
He was extremely excited
to become the son-in-law

37:55.273 --> 37:57.316
of the great Jin family
and live with them.

37:57.400 --> 37:59.694
He was the one
who got stood up on the wedding day.

38:00.278 --> 38:03.447
You have no idea how disappointed he was
to have such a marriage fall through.

38:05.283 --> 38:07.285
But you all asked to see her
without considering his feelings?

38:08.828 --> 38:12.081
Think about how hurt his pride would be
if he saw her right now.

38:16.168 --> 38:20.589
So, Uncle, please allow me to apologize
on behalf of my immature friends here…

38:21.757 --> 38:23.384
for putting you in this situation.

38:23.467 --> 38:25.469
[dramatic music]

38:27.847 --> 38:28.681
[clanks]

38:44.822 --> 38:46.699
Were you the one who just called for me?

38:46.782 --> 38:48.034
Yes, it is late.

38:49.201 --> 38:52.163
Let us leave together
right now, okay? Let's go.

38:53.539 --> 38:55.374
Oh, but it's still early evening.

38:56.125 --> 38:57.752
Did you call for me to walk me home?

38:58.461 --> 38:59.295
Yes.

39:01.255 --> 39:03.257
Will you not get lost tonight though?

39:18.981 --> 39:19.815
I apologize.

39:20.816 --> 39:22.526
I was a bit worked up earlier.

39:23.569 --> 39:24.487
I think I'm lost again.

39:24.570 --> 39:26.364
You've been lost for a while now.

39:27.323 --> 39:29.241
But you looked upset
so I didn't say anything to you.

39:31.369 --> 39:32.203
Um…

39:32.787 --> 39:33.704
by the way,

39:35.081 --> 39:36.957
are you very ill by any chance?

39:39.460 --> 39:41.087
Like I said, I can see energy.

39:42.088 --> 39:45.299
Why is there something strange
inside your body?

39:46.675 --> 39:49.178
If you don't get rid of it,
things could really get--

39:49.261 --> 39:50.262
Pretend you saw nothing.

39:53.265 --> 39:54.100
Would you, Bu-yeon?

39:54.183 --> 39:56.227
Leaving your illness untreated
is a foolish thing to do.

39:59.730 --> 40:00.648
We said…

40:01.524 --> 40:02.900
we'd be two foolish friends, right?

40:04.902 --> 40:08.531
Please help your friend
by ignoring his foolishness.

40:10.324 --> 40:12.326
[soft music]

40:26.257 --> 40:28.759
I packed these because
they were good. Would you like one?

40:31.053 --> 40:32.930
Eating something sweet
will make you feel better.

40:37.435 --> 40:39.019
Jang Uk really likes honey biscuits.

40:39.103 --> 40:40.062
I already know.

40:41.814 --> 40:43.315
That is why I packed some of those.

40:46.986 --> 40:49.655
Then what kind of snacks do you like, Yul?

40:50.781 --> 40:53.534
I like pine pollen tea snacks more.

40:53.617 --> 40:54.743
Is that so?

40:56.078 --> 40:57.371
You have expensive taste.

41:00.166 --> 41:01.917
[reminiscent music]

41:14.096 --> 41:14.972
I once had…

41:16.515 --> 41:18.809
a similar conversation
with someone else before.

41:20.519 --> 41:23.147
Then, did they ever give the snack to you?

41:24.482 --> 41:25.441
Now that you ask,

41:26.609 --> 41:27.860
I don't think they ever did.

41:39.580 --> 41:40.706
What are you doing here?

41:41.790 --> 41:43.542
I heard that the King
has given you a command.

41:43.626 --> 41:45.419
You should go stand guard by the lake.

41:47.755 --> 41:49.715
That could not have come
from there, my lord.

41:49.798 --> 41:53.969
But still, the people are so scared
that not a single boat's sailed since.

41:55.137 --> 41:57.848
Move! There's no space.
I'm going to sleep.

41:58.807 --> 42:00.976
[Jin clears throat, exhales deeply]

42:03.687 --> 42:05.314
Are you trying to go to sleep here, Uk?

42:06.482 --> 42:08.526
- That's for sure not happening.
- I'm not here to sleep.

42:09.860 --> 42:12.696
Well, what's wrong?
Are you too excited to fall asleep?

42:12.780 --> 42:14.323
Because they say Naksu's coming back?

42:17.159 --> 42:18.327
Why are you glaring at me?

42:19.245 --> 42:21.330
You're the one who built
the stone tower and waited for her.

42:23.916 --> 42:26.168
That cairn no longer exists.
It has collapsed.

42:26.252 --> 42:27.086
Uk.

42:28.879 --> 42:31.632
Did you just change your mind
because of what I said?

42:31.715 --> 42:32.591
Of course not.

42:33.759 --> 42:36.345
- Jin Bu-yeon came and knocked it down.
- [exhales]

42:36.428 --> 42:40.015
Ah, truly! Actions do speak
louder than words.

42:40.516 --> 42:41.892
She said that she'd protect you.

42:42.393 --> 42:43.269
She's doing it.

42:43.894 --> 42:46.272
That's what she said
when she came to offer her greetings.

42:47.189 --> 42:48.899
That she'd protect you.

42:51.652 --> 42:55.197
Get out of here and go back home right now
so you can protect your bride as well.

42:56.532 --> 42:58.367
I was making dumplings in the kitchen,

42:59.368 --> 43:01.161
and the ladies there were concerned that…

43:02.121 --> 43:06.000
Naksu would end up
going after your bride when she returns.

43:06.917 --> 43:09.086
Apparently, ghosts also get jealous.

43:11.922 --> 43:13.257
So is that what they were after?

43:17.136 --> 43:17.970
What's that?

43:19.430 --> 43:22.182
My lord, I will try my best to eat
all of the dumplings that you made.

43:22.933 --> 43:24.476
So let me sleep here tonight.

43:24.560 --> 43:25.978
I have one more favor to ask you.

43:26.061 --> 43:27.855
[chuckles]
Really?

43:28.606 --> 43:29.440
[Jin chuckles]

43:29.523 --> 43:32.943
Uk, okay, I'll go
and steam some dumplings.

43:33.027 --> 43:35.904
Let us take our time talking. Yes!

43:36.947 --> 43:39.992
Fifty or a hundred?
Maybe I'll bring 50 for now.

43:44.663 --> 43:46.665
[ominous music playing]

43:53.380 --> 43:54.214
Majesty,

43:54.298 --> 43:57.676
I thought of holding a banquet
outside of the palace.

43:57.760 --> 44:00.679
I thought you didn't want anyone
to see you while you were in that body.

44:01.972 --> 44:02.973
Why have a banquet?

44:04.308 --> 44:08.520
They say all the young ladies are afraid
because of the rumors about Naksu.

44:08.604 --> 44:09.813
[scoffs]

44:09.897 --> 44:11.398
Naksu has been gone.

44:11.482 --> 44:13.817
It's silly the whole capital make
such a fuss.

44:13.901 --> 44:17.655
That's true. So you wish
to hold a banquet to lift the mood then?

44:18.280 --> 44:22.242
I will hold it on the day
of her death on purpose.

44:22.326 --> 44:23.285
[sighs]

44:24.161 --> 44:27.581
I'll gather all the young ladies
who believe Naksu is after them,

44:27.665 --> 44:31.085
and we'll enjoy a grand and regal…

44:31.835 --> 44:33.962
night to be remembered together.

44:37.216 --> 44:40.344
Her Highness the Queen has invited
Young Lady Jin to her banquet.

44:40.427 --> 44:42.262
The Queen is holding a banquet?

44:42.346 --> 44:43.889
She has not held one in years.

44:44.723 --> 44:45.724
[exhales in delight]

44:48.435 --> 44:50.396
I was invited to the Queen's banquet?

44:51.188 --> 44:52.898
Yes, young lady.
[chuckles]

44:53.732 --> 44:56.777
Every time I went to
one of the Queen's banquets in the past,

44:56.860 --> 45:00.656
it always felt so wonderful
to watch everyone fix their eyes

45:00.739 --> 45:02.199
on the one I dolled up.

45:03.283 --> 45:05.119
I'll get to feel that once again.

45:06.453 --> 45:08.539
Young lady, we do not have much time.

45:08.622 --> 45:11.625
From now on, we're going to be busy.

45:11.708 --> 45:13.627
[laughs]

45:14.461 --> 45:16.505
Clothes! We need to find the right outfit!

45:17.381 --> 45:19.591
We must get to
Dressmaker Cho's before anyone else!

45:20.592 --> 45:21.802
Mr. Lee!

45:22.636 --> 45:24.471
[upbeat music playing]

45:27.724 --> 45:29.101
Take that one back.

45:29.601 --> 45:30.894
Pretty!

45:30.978 --> 45:32.521
Oh, beautiful!

45:32.604 --> 45:33.564
No way!

45:34.398 --> 45:35.899
No way!

45:35.983 --> 45:37.234
That's from Dressmaker Cho?

45:37.317 --> 45:38.152
Oh!

45:38.235 --> 45:39.653
Uh, okay!

45:41.321 --> 45:42.156
[Maid Kim] Mm…

45:42.823 --> 45:44.783
[magical music playing]

45:46.535 --> 45:47.494
Is it a lot?

45:49.371 --> 45:50.456
It is out of trend.

45:51.707 --> 45:52.708
[sighs]

45:52.791 --> 45:55.127
[Maid Kim exclaims]

45:57.087 --> 45:57.921
Raunchy!

45:58.922 --> 46:01.592
Hmm, you look pretty in all of them.

46:01.675 --> 46:04.344
How are we going to choose
out of all these dresses?

46:04.428 --> 46:07.014
Oh, no, this is just the start.

46:07.097 --> 46:09.183
You should try
at least 30 before choosing.

46:10.350 --> 46:11.560
Thirty dresses?

46:12.478 --> 46:14.688
Next! Help her try this one on now.

46:14.771 --> 46:16.064
- Yes.
- Yes, ma'am.

46:16.148 --> 46:17.107
[gasps]

46:18.567 --> 46:20.569
[quirky music playing]

46:28.118 --> 46:29.703
Oh, come here.

46:30.913 --> 46:32.706
I want you to visit
Dressmaker Oh this time.

46:32.789 --> 46:34.708
- Again though?
- Just go now.

46:35.292 --> 46:37.586
I'm sure she feels a little uneasy
because of that rumor.

46:38.128 --> 46:41.465
If we keep her exhausted with that,
her mind will stay at peace.

46:41.548 --> 46:43.926
Okay. I'll be right back then.

46:44.009 --> 46:47.304
Ah, by the way,
Young Master Jang Uk just came home.

46:47.387 --> 46:48.889
- He's in his study now.
- Really?

46:50.015 --> 46:50.849
He came home?

46:57.272 --> 46:58.190
[door opens]

46:58.690 --> 46:59.942
She's done changing.

47:00.984 --> 47:02.194
How do I… look?

47:06.031 --> 47:06.949
You look busy.

47:08.492 --> 47:10.160
That dress is a bit
too extravagant for someone

47:10.244 --> 47:11.954
who is confident
about her looks, is it not?

47:13.080 --> 47:14.790
Please do not be mistaken, Uk.

47:14.873 --> 47:16.917
I didn't get dressed up
to look good for you.

47:17.501 --> 47:19.503
I know. I heard you were going to
the Queen's banquet.

47:21.296 --> 47:23.173
But that doesn't
necessarily mean I can't look, right?

47:26.385 --> 47:28.178
Hmm. How pretty!

47:35.185 --> 47:37.479
I mean… the dress, hmm.

47:40.691 --> 47:41.525
Give me your hand.

47:42.651 --> 47:44.152
- Why?
- You hurt your hand, didn't you,

47:44.236 --> 47:46.029
while you were taking it out
on that stone tower?

47:47.948 --> 47:49.366
[Jang Uk] Your nails have grown.

47:49.449 --> 47:50.826
Maidservant Kim can trim them for you.

47:51.785 --> 47:52.619
I'm not a child.

47:52.703 --> 47:54.329
Why would I ask her
to trim my nails for me?

47:54.413 --> 47:56.415
Do as I say. Because you are precious.

47:59.251 --> 48:00.252
I mean your nails.

48:02.504 --> 48:04.006
Why are you talking about my nails?

48:05.424 --> 48:06.258
All right.

48:06.883 --> 48:07.884
I'll leave you to it then.

48:17.477 --> 48:18.312
Uk, wait.

48:22.065 --> 48:22.899
By chance…

48:30.365 --> 48:31.366
At the banquet,

48:32.367 --> 48:33.910
make sure to sit
where you'll be able to stand out

48:33.994 --> 48:36.955
so that everybody there can see you, okay?

48:37.039 --> 48:38.540
Nobody will be interested in me.

48:38.624 --> 48:40.375
They'll all be busy talking about

48:40.459 --> 48:42.210
your real bride
who might return from the dead.

48:42.294 --> 48:44.755
That is exactly why
you should show everyone,

48:44.838 --> 48:46.256
because you're my bride now, Bu-yeon.

48:47.633 --> 48:49.843
[soft music playing]

48:52.679 --> 48:53.639
Then I…

48:56.224 --> 48:59.353
I'm going to wear an ornament
with the Jang family crest?

49:01.313 --> 49:02.522
- Yeah.
- Then I am…

49:03.815 --> 49:07.027
also going to tell everyone
that we get along very well?

49:10.447 --> 49:11.865
- Sure.
- Then I am…

49:14.868 --> 49:16.036
also going to brag

49:16.953 --> 49:19.206
to everybody that
you called the lights for me…

49:22.209 --> 49:23.210
when it was dark.

49:25.504 --> 49:27.214
Sure, go ahead and tell them.

49:37.015 --> 49:39.017
[light music playing]

49:48.235 --> 49:49.069
[chuckles]

49:53.031 --> 49:54.449
Why are you so happy now?

49:56.284 --> 49:57.869
Did you like the dresses you tried on?

49:57.953 --> 49:59.538
It's just… I saw these little bugs.

50:02.749 --> 50:04.501
And that still makes me very happy.

50:08.380 --> 50:09.548
[Bu-yeon chuckles]

50:22.728 --> 50:25.063
[Maid Kim]
Here is what Young Master Jang asked for.

50:25.647 --> 50:26.982
It won't be dangerous, right?

50:27.899 --> 50:28.817
Do not worry.

50:30.527 --> 50:33.572
Will you also be attending
the banquet tonight?

50:33.655 --> 50:34.823
Yeah.

50:34.906 --> 50:37.951
You look very beautiful in that dress.

50:39.661 --> 50:41.204
This is what I always wear.

50:41.913 --> 50:44.249
I'll be wearing a nicer dress
to the banquet.

50:44.332 --> 50:46.918
So you're saying you will look even

50:47.002 --> 50:49.337
more beautiful than you do now,
Maidservant Kim?

50:49.421 --> 50:51.006
[laughs]
Oh, my lord.

50:51.089 --> 50:52.257
There's no need for that.

50:53.008 --> 50:55.010
If you look even prettier than you do now,

50:55.093 --> 50:59.181
imagine how intimidated
the young ladies will feel at the banquet.

51:00.640 --> 51:01.475
Do you think so?

51:02.559 --> 51:04.728
Should… I go easy on them?

51:04.811 --> 51:07.147
Yes, you should go easy. Easy!

51:07.230 --> 51:08.440
All right then.

51:09.733 --> 51:12.319
Since this is the first time
you go out in public,

51:12.402 --> 51:13.737
you should dress nicely as well.

51:13.820 --> 51:17.991
Because I like a man
who dresses strong, yeah!

51:18.074 --> 51:22.913
All right. I will show you
how dashing I can be.

51:25.749 --> 51:28.543
[laughing]

51:38.970 --> 51:39.888
Young Master Park.

51:40.514 --> 51:41.348
[door closes]

51:47.270 --> 51:49.439
Maidservant Kim. You're leaving now?

51:49.523 --> 51:52.317
Yeah, I'll be attending
with Young Lady Bu-yeon.

51:52.400 --> 51:54.986
Then if you happen
to meet Young Lady Jin there…

51:57.364 --> 51:59.783
could you give these to her for me?

52:00.700 --> 52:01.618
Oh!

52:01.701 --> 52:04.454
These are diamonds called
"The Dragon's Tears."

52:04.538 --> 52:06.623
I heard someone bought them
not too long ago.

52:07.499 --> 52:09.835
- How did you get them?
- I just bought them.

52:10.877 --> 52:14.464
But if she--
if Young Lady Jin decides to wear these,

52:14.548 --> 52:16.800
everyone will be aware
that they are from you.

52:17.384 --> 52:20.136
I'm not sure if she will accept these.

52:20.220 --> 52:21.596
If she refuses,

52:22.472 --> 52:24.099
that would mean she turned me down.

52:25.892 --> 52:28.103
Uh, never mind then. If I give her these

52:28.186 --> 52:30.522
and she finally rejects me,
I will not be able to bear it.

52:32.232 --> 52:35.819
Then, you really don't want to
find out how she feels about you forever?

52:38.488 --> 52:40.365
Will she accept it…

52:41.533 --> 52:44.619
- or refuse it?
- You'll know once you give them to her.

52:46.454 --> 52:47.622
I guess you're right.

52:47.706 --> 52:50.000
Like how you have to bite
a rice cake to see what's inside.

52:50.083 --> 52:51.251
[door opens]

52:56.464 --> 52:57.299
[Maid Kim coughs]

53:02.262 --> 53:03.305
Uncle Jin.

53:04.389 --> 53:05.557
I want it to be filled with honey,

53:05.640 --> 53:07.767
but I'm afraid
it's filled with fish sauce.

53:07.851 --> 53:10.145
But I will check for myself too

53:10.896 --> 53:12.480
and swallow it if it's my destiny.

53:15.817 --> 53:17.110
Please give these to her.

53:23.575 --> 53:26.453
The Queen's banquet
is starting soon, Your Royal Highness.

53:28.163 --> 53:29.581
So has Jin Bu-yeon already arrived?

53:29.664 --> 53:32.959
Everyone who was invited has arrived,
she should be there by now as well.

53:33.710 --> 53:34.669
And Uk?

53:34.753 --> 53:35.962
I heard he's out sailing

53:36.046 --> 53:37.923
on Lake Gyeongcheondaeho
on the King's command.

53:41.051 --> 53:44.346
If a soul shifter appears at the banquet,
attacks Jin Bu-yeon and kills her,

53:45.513 --> 53:47.682
who do you think the people
will believe that soul shifter to be?

53:47.766 --> 53:51.478
Of course, they will all believe
Naksu to be the soul shifter.

53:51.561 --> 53:54.898
If Jin Bu-yeon does get attacked,
it will be Naksu's doing.

53:56.441 --> 53:58.902
And Jang Uk will have to
take the blame for all of it.

54:00.570 --> 54:04.491
Naksu will be the one
who can separate the two of them.

54:06.326 --> 54:08.703
Royal Highness, why don't you
attend the banquet as well?

54:09.663 --> 54:11.331
You'll have to choose
a crown princess soon.

54:11.414 --> 54:14.626
And it will most likely be
one of the ladies at the banquet tonight.

54:14.709 --> 54:16.586
You should pick
the woman you like beforehand.

54:17.921 --> 54:18.755
I can't.

54:20.340 --> 54:22.133
That is not something I can decide.

54:22.217 --> 54:24.219
And I'm afraid of what
I might end up doing

54:24.302 --> 54:26.012
if I fall for someone I cannot have.

54:35.146 --> 54:37.732
[Ho-gyeong] I don't wish to have
anyone from Songrim here.

54:37.816 --> 54:39.025
Why have you come?

54:42.404 --> 54:43.863
I am not here for Songrim.

54:44.614 --> 54:46.199
I have come for a child,

54:47.325 --> 54:49.786
who I see as a son, and your girl.

54:49.869 --> 54:51.579
If you are talking about Bu-yeon,

54:52.247 --> 54:55.250
then you must order Jang Uk
to send her back to Jinyowon at once.

54:55.333 --> 54:57.252
Before that, Naksu.

54:59.921 --> 55:00.922
We have to catch her.

55:01.006 --> 55:03.341
Naksu's dead. Don't tell me you also

55:03.425 --> 55:05.885
believe these ridiculous rumors now.

55:05.969 --> 55:09.597
These ridiculous rumors could end up
killing your daughter, Lady Jin.

55:11.391 --> 55:12.934
We need Jinyowon's help.

55:17.439 --> 55:19.899
[traditional music playing]

55:24.487 --> 55:27.240
I am the second daughter
of Jinyowon, Jin Cho-yeon.

55:30.035 --> 55:30.869
Then…

55:32.037 --> 55:33.788
you are the daughter
of that shaman's brother.

55:42.088 --> 55:44.299
I'm Heo Yun-ok of the Heo family.

55:44.382 --> 55:46.843
She's the granddaughter
of Master Heo Yeom, Your Highness.

55:48.595 --> 55:49.971
You didn't have to greet me again.

55:50.055 --> 55:52.640
We see each other quite often,
my dear physician.

55:52.724 --> 55:53.933
[chuckles]

56:00.690 --> 56:02.150
[girls murmuring]

56:12.243 --> 56:14.496
I'm the eldest daughter
of the Jin family, Jin Bu-yeon.

56:14.579 --> 56:17.165
She is betrothed to
Young Master Jang Uk as of now.

56:17.248 --> 56:19.000
I heard they were already married.

56:20.043 --> 56:22.045
We're preparing a grand wedding ceremony.

56:22.629 --> 56:24.380
We ask for your blessing.

56:24.464 --> 56:26.549
Then you are still of Jinyowon.

56:27.342 --> 56:30.762
I invited one person from each family.
But now there are two of you.

56:31.888 --> 56:33.515
Send the second Jin daughter away.

56:33.598 --> 56:36.518
[crowd murmuring]

56:39.562 --> 56:40.396
Your Majesty.

56:40.480 --> 56:44.359
The second daughter, Jin Cho-yeon,
is now the heir to Jinyowon.

56:44.442 --> 56:46.569
If one of us must leave right now,

56:46.653 --> 56:49.656
then it should be me,
not my younger sister.

56:54.077 --> 56:54.911
Forget it.

56:54.994 --> 56:57.705
You have already come,
so enjoy the banquet.

56:58.957 --> 57:02.168
Thank you very much for allowing
both of us to stay, Your Majesty.

57:03.253 --> 57:04.712
[ominous music playing]

57:19.269 --> 57:23.356
It feels good to be outside again
for the first time in a while.

57:23.440 --> 57:26.609
Now then,
let us enjoy the banquet tonight.

57:26.693 --> 57:29.446
[all applaud, cheer]

57:30.697 --> 57:33.241
[traditional music playing]

57:38.872 --> 57:40.206
They're beautiful, right?

57:41.916 --> 57:42.959
[chuckling]

57:47.714 --> 57:48.590
[man 1] There!

57:49.549 --> 57:50.884
[man 2] I'm not playing anymore.

57:50.967 --> 57:52.760
[man 1] Come on, hey, one more time.

57:52.844 --> 57:55.221
[indistinct chatter]

57:55.305 --> 57:56.848
Damn it. Seriously?

57:58.057 --> 57:59.267
What is he doing here?

58:00.018 --> 58:02.103
I told him to stay away
until later tonight.

58:02.187 --> 58:05.023
Oh, no! I guess old habits die hard.

58:05.773 --> 58:07.817
He probably came to play
since he has money now.

58:07.901 --> 58:08.943
Piece of shit!

58:09.027 --> 58:11.571
[man 3] Time out! Time out!
We do not play there anymore.

58:12.238 --> 58:16.743
Let me see. Let me see.
Let me see! I won! I won! I won!

58:16.826 --> 58:18.495
Who here is the gambler, Byeong-gu?

58:19.245 --> 58:21.247
[suspenseful music playing]

58:23.458 --> 58:24.292
[man 4] Byeong-gu?

58:25.668 --> 58:28.838
Hey, you should leave
if you're not gambling, huh.

58:28.922 --> 58:29.797
Move now!

58:30.465 --> 58:31.382
[man 5 grunts]

58:32.091 --> 58:33.259
[worker] Hey, relax.

58:33.885 --> 58:34.719
Argh!

58:35.637 --> 58:36.638
[men grunting]

58:52.612 --> 58:54.405
[So-i pants]
Keep quiet and go.

58:54.489 --> 58:55.365
[Byeong-gu] I'm sorry!

58:55.907 --> 58:56.741
[So-i] Hurry!

58:58.201 --> 58:59.619
Didn't I tell you not to come back?

58:59.702 --> 59:02.413
- Piece of shit! I told you!
- I'm sorry!

59:02.497 --> 59:04.499
[ominous music]

59:10.338 --> 59:11.172
It was you.

59:13.383 --> 59:15.385
[tense music intensifying]

59:20.974 --> 59:22.809
[traditional music playing]

59:25.395 --> 59:27.397
[girls chattering, laughing]

59:34.487 --> 59:36.656
She's been married to Jang Uk.
Where is he then?

59:36.739 --> 59:38.199
I don't really believe
what they're saying.

59:42.453 --> 59:43.454
So you must be hurt.

59:44.622 --> 59:47.166
Since you were introduced
as Uk's betrothed, not his wife.

59:47.250 --> 59:50.336
It is all right.
Uk shows me more than enough affection.

59:52.505 --> 59:55.800
Did you not understand
the advice I gave you earlier?

59:55.883 --> 59:57.218
I understood very well, Yun-ok.

59:58.011 --> 01:00:00.471
Thanks to you,
there were some difficulties between us,

01:00:00.555 --> 01:00:02.098
but we've become closer.

01:00:02.682 --> 01:00:03.516
So thank you.

01:00:13.610 --> 01:00:18.281
Everyone, Young Master Jang
of the Jang family sent fireworks

01:00:18.364 --> 01:00:21.242
earlier today
to celebrate this special night.

01:00:21.326 --> 01:00:24.287
[girls exclaim]

01:00:24.871 --> 01:00:26.623
[girl] Do you think
we're gonna get to see them?

01:00:26.706 --> 01:00:27.999
I've never seen them before.

01:00:28.082 --> 01:00:30.376
He has sent them because his betrothed

01:00:30.460 --> 01:00:32.670
asked him if he was able
to light up the night sky

01:00:32.754 --> 01:00:34.172
for Her Young Lady this night.

01:00:34.255 --> 01:00:36.966
- [girls exclaim]
- [girl 1] I'm so jealous of her.

01:00:37.050 --> 01:00:38.009
[girl 2] Jealous!

01:00:39.010 --> 01:00:43.681
Very soon, the cannons will be lit
and flowers will bloom in the sky.

01:00:44.265 --> 01:00:45.391
I hope you'll enjoy.

01:00:45.475 --> 01:00:47.060
[girls applaud, cheer]

01:00:49.395 --> 01:00:50.897
[girl] Should we watch it from out there?

01:00:50.980 --> 01:00:53.066
[traditional music playing]

01:01:02.950 --> 01:01:04.285
[tea pouring]

01:01:04.369 --> 01:01:05.787
You should go to the garden now.

01:01:23.805 --> 01:01:26.432
You came here to do it yourself?

01:01:28.309 --> 01:01:30.561
To light up the night for me?

01:01:31.854 --> 01:01:32.689
Yes.

01:01:33.439 --> 01:01:35.566
So did you get to boast a lot?

01:01:36.609 --> 01:01:41.072
Thanks to you, not a single person here
doubts that I am your bride anymore.

01:01:41.155 --> 01:01:42.281
Okay, that's good.

01:01:42.365 --> 01:01:45.118
Then that means
Naksu's gonna show up here then.

01:01:46.327 --> 01:01:47.161
Naksu?

01:01:47.245 --> 01:01:50.873
Because this event was actually
arranged to summon Naksu's spirit.

01:01:52.250 --> 01:01:53.084
Why?

01:01:54.669 --> 01:01:58.423
It was created so that my wife
would die by the hands of Naksu.

01:01:58.506 --> 01:01:59.924
[tense music]

01:02:00.007 --> 01:02:01.134
Jin Bu-yeon.

01:02:02.218 --> 01:02:03.052
I'm sorry but…

01:02:04.262 --> 01:02:05.763
you'll have to die here tonight.

01:02:11.018 --> 01:02:12.645
[girls cheering, laughing]

01:02:19.444 --> 01:02:22.363
[girls screaming]

01:02:40.006 --> 01:02:42.008
[ominous music playing]

01:02:44.177 --> 01:02:47.638
If Jin Bu-yeon were killed in public
at the hands of a soul shifter,

01:02:47.722 --> 01:02:49.849
then everyone will
believe that it's Naksu,

01:02:50.433 --> 01:02:52.477
and Jang Uk will have to
take the fall for it all.

01:02:53.895 --> 01:02:56.063
Jang Uk and Jinyowon will become enemies.

01:02:56.147 --> 01:02:59.525
Jinyowon will then
be yours for the taking.

01:03:04.197 --> 01:03:06.032
[ominous music continues playing]

01:03:25.927 --> 01:03:27.762
[tense music playing]

01:03:47.114 --> 01:03:48.157
[sword rasps]

01:03:49.158 --> 01:03:51.202
[all screaming]

01:03:55.748 --> 01:03:57.375
[Cho-yeon gasps]
Bu-yeon!

01:03:59.919 --> 01:04:01.087
Bu-yeon.

01:04:02.046 --> 01:04:03.130
[sobs]Bu-yeon.

01:04:04.632 --> 01:04:05.591
It has to be Naksu.

01:04:06.509 --> 01:04:10.596
Naksu has killed Jang Uk's bride,
Jin Bu-yeon. Oh, god!

01:04:10.680 --> 01:04:12.431
[girls gasp]

01:04:17.061 --> 01:04:17.895
[Cho-yeon] Bu-yeon.

01:04:19.188 --> 01:04:20.064
[Cho-yeon whimpers]

01:04:20.940 --> 01:04:21.774
Bu-yeon…

01:04:30.867 --> 01:04:32.368
- [all exclaim]
- [sword clatters]

01:04:38.708 --> 01:04:40.960
[all screaming]

01:04:41.043 --> 01:04:42.336
[girl] What's going on?

01:04:43.713 --> 01:04:45.298
[Maid Kim] Young Lady Bu-yeon is safe.

01:04:46.674 --> 01:04:48.551
[all murmur]

01:04:53.264 --> 01:04:56.017
[all murmur]

01:05:04.191 --> 01:05:06.611
How… are you still alive?

01:05:08.571 --> 01:05:09.864
[Queen] I just saw you die.

01:05:10.781 --> 01:05:12.783
What died just now wasn't me

01:05:12.867 --> 01:05:15.578
but a relic of Jinyowon,
a white mouse called Gwiseo.

01:05:16.162 --> 01:05:17.455
"Gwiseo"?

01:05:18.080 --> 01:05:22.126
A mouse that eats one's fingernails,
takes appearance of its owner

01:05:22.209 --> 01:05:23.252
and wanders about.

01:05:24.295 --> 01:05:26.380
The relic mouse that ate our Young Lady's

01:05:27.131 --> 01:05:29.717
and took on her human-form
was stabbed instead.

01:05:29.800 --> 01:05:30.801
She's right.

01:05:31.636 --> 01:05:34.388
What you saw was Gwiseo from Jinyowon.

01:05:39.685 --> 01:05:40.937
How did that get here just now?

01:05:42.480 --> 01:05:46.275
Your mother sent the relic
over here to protect her.

01:05:49.862 --> 01:05:51.948
[dramatic music]

01:06:04.126 --> 01:06:07.004
It seems like everything went well.

01:06:07.088 --> 01:06:08.756
Now all that's left…

01:06:10.216 --> 01:06:12.009
is for Uk to catch the soul shifter.

01:06:16.555 --> 01:06:18.391
The soul shifter that attacked me

01:06:18.474 --> 01:06:20.726
is being chased
by Young Master Jang right now.

01:06:25.064 --> 01:06:27.316
If the people do not see me
get rid of Naksu myself,

01:06:28.275 --> 01:06:30.277
then they will continue to talk about her.

01:06:32.154 --> 01:06:34.156
I want her to rest in peace, so…

01:06:37.868 --> 01:06:39.286
I would really like you to help me out.

01:06:41.163 --> 01:06:43.290
Once he gets rid of Naksu here soon,

01:06:44.083 --> 01:06:44.917
Naksu…

01:06:46.502 --> 01:06:47.962
will disappear forever.

01:06:57.555 --> 01:06:59.140
[crowd screaming]

01:07:03.227 --> 01:07:04.353
- [man] Is it Naksu?
- [woman] Oh, my god!

01:07:04.437 --> 01:07:06.147
[crowd murmuring]

01:07:06.731 --> 01:07:08.065
- [woman] She looks dead.
- [man] Ugh!

01:07:12.153 --> 01:07:14.030
[man] It's dead. It's dead.

01:07:14.113 --> 01:07:16.157
[crowd murmuring]

01:07:19.035 --> 01:07:19.869
[all gasp]

01:07:20.369 --> 01:07:22.872
[heroic music playing]

01:07:39.805 --> 01:07:42.933
Today, I got rid of the soul shifter Naksu

01:07:43.017 --> 01:07:44.518
who appeared at the Queen's banquet.

01:07:45.770 --> 01:07:47.730
Was it really Naksu's spirit though?

01:07:49.065 --> 01:07:51.901
She went after Jang Uk's betrothed,
so it must have been Naksu.

01:07:52.485 --> 01:07:54.612
Now that Naksu
is finally gone from this world,

01:07:55.863 --> 01:07:56.697
indefinitely…

01:08:00.868 --> 01:08:02.078
I hope this puts you at ease…

01:08:04.163 --> 01:08:05.414
and gives you peace of mind.

01:08:27.144 --> 01:08:31.273
I orchestrated it with the shamans here
to make some money from selling charms.

01:08:33.901 --> 01:08:37.446
I was just making up a rumor.
But go on, arrest me if you want.

01:08:43.911 --> 01:08:45.329
You keep sending me medicine.

01:08:48.082 --> 01:08:49.792
You must know what's inside my body.

01:08:52.211 --> 01:08:53.671
You shouldn't have any problems…

01:08:54.547 --> 01:08:55.756
if you keep taking medicine.

01:08:56.549 --> 01:08:57.383
But I…

01:08:59.718 --> 01:09:01.345
have never taken the medicine.

01:09:03.931 --> 01:09:05.141
What do you mean by that?

01:09:05.224 --> 01:09:06.851
[dramatic music]

01:09:06.934 --> 01:09:09.145
Without that medicine,
you must be in severe pain.

01:09:09.854 --> 01:09:10.688
Please tell me,

01:09:11.522 --> 01:09:12.982
what do I have inside my body?

01:09:15.484 --> 01:09:16.527
I'd like to know…

01:09:18.946 --> 01:09:20.030
before I die soon.

01:09:27.288 --> 01:09:30.040
I heard the soul shifter Naksu died.

01:09:30.124 --> 01:09:32.251
- Yes, right.
- Tell me in detail.

01:09:32.334 --> 01:09:34.503
- [Master Lee] Yeom. I'm here!
- Huh?

01:09:35.421 --> 01:09:37.923
- [Master Lee] Yeom!
- Huh, huh, Master Lee!

01:09:38.007 --> 01:09:40.176
[grunts excitedly]
Master Lee!

01:09:40.885 --> 01:09:42.469
[laughs]

01:09:42.970 --> 01:09:43.804
Master!

01:09:44.597 --> 01:09:45.431
Master!

01:09:50.561 --> 01:09:53.731
Master, where have you been all this time?

01:09:53.814 --> 01:09:55.232
It has been almost three years.

01:09:55.316 --> 01:09:58.194
My dear Yeom, you've aged
even more since then.

01:09:58.277 --> 01:10:00.196
[Heo Yeom chuckles]

01:10:00.279 --> 01:10:03.490
Where… where have you
been then, tell me, huh?

01:10:03.574 --> 01:10:04.700
I couldn't find you anywhere!

01:10:04.783 --> 01:10:07.161
I had been spending time
treating a special patient.

01:10:07.244 --> 01:10:08.204
What patient?

01:10:08.287 --> 01:10:09.872
It was actually Lady Jin's daughter.

01:10:10.581 --> 01:10:12.499
I heard that she recently married Jang Uk.

01:10:12.583 --> 01:10:13.417
What?

01:10:13.918 --> 01:10:17.046
Jin Bu-yeon? So she was treated by you.

01:10:17.129 --> 01:10:17.963
[Master Lee] Correct!

01:10:18.631 --> 01:10:21.508
I went and saved her life, woke her up,

01:10:22.426 --> 01:10:23.677
so she has a new life.

01:10:25.346 --> 01:10:26.180
[Heo Yeom] Oh.

01:10:37.316 --> 01:10:38.150
[Jin] You…

01:10:38.692 --> 01:10:41.028
have yet to visit the cliff
where she died, right?

01:10:41.987 --> 01:10:44.782
See it for yourself
and then mourn for her.

01:10:44.865 --> 01:10:45.866
[Jang Uk sighs]

01:10:46.742 --> 01:10:48.744
["Raindrops" by Gummy playing]

01:11:05.010 --> 01:11:06.512
[Jang Uk] I want her to rest in peace.

01:11:07.805 --> 01:11:09.974
[Maid Kim]
That may not have been the real Naksu,

01:11:10.057 --> 01:11:12.726
but on the days he has used
the power of the ice stone,

01:11:12.810 --> 01:11:15.646
the wraiths tend to swarm
around him even more.

01:11:25.239 --> 01:11:26.615
[sighs]

01:11:26.699 --> 01:11:28.575
[Mu-deok]
You are the first person who's ever tried…

01:11:29.868 --> 01:11:31.412
to save my life.

01:11:32.538 --> 01:11:33.998
[Jang Uk] I came back
from the dead thanks to you.

01:11:35.416 --> 01:11:36.750
My crazy master.

01:11:38.210 --> 01:11:39.420
[Mu-deok] My pupil.

01:11:40.754 --> 01:11:43.257
[Jang Uk] I, Jang Uk,
promise to serve and protect

01:11:43.340 --> 01:11:44.967
my master, Mu-deok, with my life.

01:11:46.885 --> 01:11:50.014
[Mu-deok] Right now, I am
the egg in that bird's nest

01:11:50.097 --> 01:11:51.265
at the top of the tree.

01:11:52.308 --> 01:11:54.393
You're the only person
who can take care of me.

01:11:55.352 --> 01:11:56.270
[Jang Uk] Sure.

01:11:56.854 --> 01:12:00.065
I will take you to the top of
wherever you want to go.

01:12:03.360 --> 01:12:05.112
I missed you too, a lot.

01:12:05.195 --> 01:12:06.488
That's my response.

01:12:08.782 --> 01:12:09.616
[Mu-deok] Listen.

01:12:11.285 --> 01:12:12.911
Jang Uk, I like you a lot.

01:12:18.500 --> 01:12:19.710
- [Bu-yeon] Jang Uk.
- [song ends]

01:12:28.552 --> 01:12:30.554
[soft music playing]

01:12:54.536 --> 01:12:55.371
Jang Uk.

01:12:56.663 --> 01:12:57.706
Are you okay?

01:13:09.676 --> 01:13:10.844
I could not cry.

01:13:13.347 --> 01:13:14.181
Because…

01:13:16.725 --> 01:13:18.519
it felt like I was really
abandoning you there.

01:13:19.436 --> 01:13:21.438
["Raindrops" continues playing]

01:14:25.836 --> 01:14:26.879
[Jang Uk sighs]

01:14:49.151 --> 01:14:51.236
["Blue Flower" by LIA playing]

01:15:25.604 --> 01:15:28.524
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

01:15:28.607 --> 01:15:30.526
[Master Lee]
Even if I didn't force those two…

01:15:30.609 --> 01:15:33.070
You, of all people,
completely took the one thing

01:15:33.153 --> 01:15:35.197
she had tried so desperately to hide.

01:15:36.406 --> 01:15:37.449
You must also stop this.

01:15:37.533 --> 01:15:39.201
If you truly wish for me to stop,

01:15:39.284 --> 01:15:42.120
just go to Jang Uk
and tell him the truth about everything.

01:15:42.204 --> 01:15:44.414
[Seo Yul] I came here
for the last time to sort things out.

01:15:44.498 --> 01:15:46.041
[Bu-yeon] You're about to cry, Yul.

01:15:46.124 --> 01:15:49.419
[Seo Yul] Tear it out and crush the heart.

01:15:50.546 --> 01:15:53.382
I'm always going to stay
by your side at this distance.

01:15:54.883 --> 01:15:55.926
[Bu-yeon] That's a promise.
